  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategies for Community Development and Conservation on the Coast of Oaxaca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecosta will undertake a program emphasizing economic development and the conservation of natural resources in 12 communities in the municipality of San Pedro Tututepec, Oaxaca. The goal is to improve family food production through environmentally responsible practices, expand ecotourism initiatives, launch small businesses, further wildlife protection and increase Ecostas existing loan fund. More than 400 Mexicans of indigenous, African and mestizo descent will benefit. (ME-492)</narrative>
  </description>
